{"id":"d8e9868412be2384","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness.md","title":"c.e. 外延指标类的有限见证","display":"lem-ce-index-finite-witness — c.e. 外延指标类的有限见证","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness","aliases":["20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness"],"display":"lem-ce-index-finite-witness — c.e. 外延指标类的有限见证","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.4.20 的第二步","source_printed_pages":[42,43],"source_pdf_pages":[78,79],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-thm-recursion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-ce-index-finite-witness — c.e. 外延指标类的有限见证"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.4.20 的第二步"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>42</span><span>43</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>78</span><span>79</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal K\\}\">\\(S=\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal K\\}\\)</span> 是 c.e.；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(W\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce-index-finite-witness}\\vdash\n\\exists F\\subseteq W\\ [|F|&lt;\\omega\\land F\\in\\mathcal K].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce-index-finite-witness}\\vdash\n\\exists F\\subseteq W\\ [|F|&lt;\\omega\\land F\\in\\mathcal K].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归定理给索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>：逐阶段枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>，但一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in S\">\\(n\\in S\\)</span> 被发现就永久停止枚举。若永不发现，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n=W\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(W_n=W\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span> 又使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 最终进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，矛盾。因而在有限阶段停止，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=W_n\">\\(F=W_n\\)</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in S\">\\(n\\in S\\)</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(F\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span>。每阶段只枚举有限内容，边界情形 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\varnothing\">\\(F=\\varnothing\\)</span> 允许。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.4.20 的第二步；印刷页 42, 43；PDF 第 78, 79 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal K\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce-index-finite-witness}\\vdash\n\\exists F\\subseteq W\\ [|F|<\\omega\\land F\\in\\mathcal K].","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"W_n=W\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"F=W_n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1349,"backlinks":[{"id":"56a014e11e7bd842","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","416559051d6f8f46"]}